 "notes": [
  "Dates are the dates notified for government holiday purposes. Lunar-calendar festivals move every year and can differ by region and by moon sighting; every activation shows the dates for owner approval.",
  "Every date was read from the notification document itself on 2026-10-09 (docs/scheduler/FESTIVAL_CALENDAR_VERIFICATION.md records how, with document hashes).",
  "A record with status 'unverified' is never scheduled until the owner confirms it (status -> published). The owner can correct a date or mark a record disputed at any time; corrections are kept in the scheduler state, not here.",
  "'solemn' observances are listed for completeness and are not offered for greeting GIFs by default.",
  "Sikkim records come from the Government of Sikkim notification and carry region 'sikkim'. Sikkim observes some festivals on dates that differ from the Government of India list (Holi 2026-03-03, Ram Navami 2026-03-27, Laxmi Puja 2026-11-09..11); these are separate records, never merged with the national ones.",
  "Sikkim 2027 holidays are not notified yet (the 2026 list was notified on 2025-10-10). No Sikkim 2027 date is guessed."
 ],
